                  "children": {
                    "true": [
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "Mars has the largest\ncanyon in the Solar\nSystem, Valles\nMarineris. To say it",
                            "dwarfs the Grand\nCanyon would be an\nunderstatement,\nbecause at 2,500",
                            "miles long it would\nspan the entire\nUnited States."
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 4,
                          "maxHeight": 7,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 4,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30,
                          "__collapse": true
                        },
                        "id": "029d8028-3e99-4635-8a71-9828c1ac1e5b"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "Before he died in\n1996, astronomer Carl\nSagan recorded a\nmessage for the first",
                            "people to step on \nMartian soil, which\nwas brought to Mars in\n2008 Phoenix lander:"
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 4,
                          "maxHeight": 7,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 4,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
                          "speedIn": -1,
                          "speedOut": -1,
                          "closeWhen": "key",
                          "closeButton": "a",
                          "closeDelayTime": 0.5,
                          "closeDelayFrames": 30,
                          "__collapse": true
                        },
                        "id": "8051c2c4-2bb0-4a2a-9b24-7ac49e4d78d6"
                      },
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "\"...maybe we're on\nMars because we have\nto be. Because\nthere's a deep",
                            "nomadic impulse built\ninto us...and through\n99.9% of our tenure on\nEarth we've been",
                            "wanderers, and the\nnext place to wander\nto is Mars.\""
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 4,
                          "maxHeight": 7,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
                          "textHeight": 5,
                          "position": "bottom",
                          "clearPrevious": true,
                          "showFrame": "true",
